<div class="deck">
  <section class="slide"><div class="kicker">Efficient Multimodal Models · Hugging Face × Stanford</div><h1>SmolVLM: Redefining Small and Efficient Multimodal Models</h1><div class="row two"><div class="card"><p>Compact VLMs that stay competitive while reducing runtime memory from <strong>27.7GB</strong> to as low as <strong>0.8GB</strong>.</p><p class="muted">Audience: ML researchers, on-device AI engineers, graduate students.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="img" src="/app/benchmark/assets/figure_3.jpg" alt="SmolVLM architecture"/></div></div><div class="footer">Source: /app/benchmark/source_brief.md</div></section>
